e bridge. Pick flowers in peaceful fields and take your time discovering every corner. The world is handcrafted, colorful, and made to be enjoyed slowly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/24824fb341c5e3cfb46a9b3f20894c8c.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/24824fb341c5e3cfb46a9b3f20894c8c.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/24824fb341c5e3cfb46a9b3f20894c8c.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📖 A Heartwarming Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow a gentle story about understanding and discovering the secrets of two very different worlds.</strong> As you help the Huglings rebuild their village, you'll meet charming characters, uncover the mystery behind the goblins' strange behavior, and set off on a heartfelt adventure filled with curiosity, friendship, and memorable moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Adventure Continues</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main story takes around 8–12 hours</strong> to complete, but your adventure doesn't end there. Continue decorating your village, expanding your farm, completing daily quests, and discovering new ways to enjoy island life. With seasonal updates planned, there will always be new reasons to return to the world of Huglings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/b04404252f38507f78800d331ce6d550.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/b04404252f38507f78800d331ce6d550.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/b04404252f38507f78800d331ce6d550.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏡 Your Dream Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make a house that’s truly yours, decorate every corner exactly how you like</strong>, inside and out, including your very own garden. Choose from a wide variety of furniture, plants, and cozy decorations to create a warm, personal space. In multiplayer, you and your friends can decorate a house together, mix and match styles, and bring your dream cozy world to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/d9719cd1a9a3f6ffeabe08dc38c5c8c4.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/d9719cd1a9a3f6ffeabe08dc38c5c8c4.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/d9719cd1a9a3f6ffeabe08dc38c5c8c4.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎨 Deep Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring your Hugling to life exactly how you imagine.</strong> Choose every detail from hairstyles and hats to cute cat-ear headphones, backpacks, and all their colors. Whether you’re going for cute, quirky, or completely your own style, your Hugling becomes a true reflection of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/91c5c657dad9ab7c89717cf884cfb9e7.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/91c5c657dad9ab7c89717cf884cfb9e7.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/91c5c657dad9ab7c89717cf884cfb9e7.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐾 Adorable Pet Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose a sweet little companion to follow you on your journey.</strong> Your pet stays by your side wherever you go, sharing every step of the adventure with you. A quiet presence, a loyal friend because everything feels cozier with company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/a1b886ee4308438a6c379374a73bd902.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/a1b886ee4308438a6c379374a73bd902.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/a1b886ee4308438a6c379374a73bd902.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐰 Cute Animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The village is full of cute animals just waiting to be cared for.</strong> Feed them, give them attention, and watch them react with little hearts, showing their love for you. Spending time with these sweet companions is a calm, heartwarming way to add life and charm to your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/eafbde74185842cbc62128cf53307783.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/eafbde74185842cbc62128cf53307783.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/eafbde74185842cbc62128cf53307783.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💫 The Enchanted Goblin Village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a magical world unlike any other.</strong> The goblin village is full of strange, wondrous plants, mysterious animals, and whimsical details at every turn. The goblins themselves are playful tricksters full of mischief, but never aggressive. To bring peace between the Huglings and goblins, you’ll need curiosity and kindness. It’s a colorful, enchanting place that invites you to discover, and see life from a whole new perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/cc45c78a2f8fa56fdd07acf7c67b7bd3.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/cc45c78a2f8fa56fdd07acf7c67b7bd3.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/cc45c78a2f8fa56fdd07acf7c67b7bd3.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌱 Farming &amp; Homegrown Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tend your garden and grow your own crops at home.</strong> Sell your harvest to unlock charming new decorations and furniture for your house. Farming is a peaceful, cozy activity, watch your plants flourish as you nurture them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/e5c3f381ad57aa9dd822798d4a027789.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/e5c3f381ad57aa9dd822798d4a027789.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/e5c3f381ad57aa9dd822798d4a027789.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌿 <strong>Gathering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roam the world as you gather essential resources for crafting and survival.</strong> Chop wood from sturdy trees, mine stone from rocky cliffs, and collect valuable raw materials along the way. Pick colorful flowers, harvest berries from wild bushes, and enjoy the simple magic of gathering everything nature has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/d13894f944a76f02ab9061485c12aaf2.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/d13894f944a76f02ab9061485c12aaf2.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/d13894f944a76f02ab9061485c12aaf2.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Cozy Adventures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take your time and enjoy the journey - there’s no rush and no wrong way to play.</strong> Solve challenges with kindness instead of fighting, and make friends with the villagers who help you along the way. Huglings is all about wandering at your own pace, discovering hidden secrets, and creating heartwarming memories in a gentle, enchanting world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/ca66d4919b54851dd9bc2c961163bc41.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/ca66d4919b54851dd9bc2c961163bc41.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/ca66d4919b54851dd9bc2c961163bc41.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dev team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/656a7a4a53832e18e1a42164fa2fa405.poster.avif?t=1788100296\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/656a7a4a53832e18e1a42164fa2fa405.webm?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/extras/656a7a4a53832e18e1a42164fa2fa405.mp4?t=1788100296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, this is Marcell and Karina talking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marcell is the programmer, and Karina is the game designer behind this little project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our very first game, and it's been a wonderful learning experience for both of us. We're still beginners, but we’re doing our very best and sincerely hope you’ll enjoy our little game as much as we enjoyed making it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being here and supporting our first adventure 💖</p>", "short_description": "Huglings is a cozy adventure for 1-4 players where you can help the huglings restore their village, which was damaged by the goblins. Create peace as you farm, craft, and decorate your dream home. No pressure, just a peaceful world to explore and a heartwarming journey of friendship and helpfulness!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/7b49b5fa4a5300be273653d7966125e41b29682e/header.jpg?t=1788100296", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/27da092a3bd4e3a65a70aa092dfe9295213ffb60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788100296", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/27da092a3bd4e3a65a70aa092dfe9295213ffb60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788100296", "website": "https://huglingsgame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-13100 / AMD Ryzen 3 5300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 630 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8500 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 4GB or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Cuddlecados"], "publishers": ["Papucs Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 4668910, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/1730053eff9357f43b91cc2e979957676ddbb750/ss_1730053eff9357f43b91cc2e979957676ddbb750.600x338.jpg?t=1788100296", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/1730053eff9357f43b91cc2e979957676ddbb750/ss_1730053eff9357f43b91cc2e979957676ddbb750.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788100296"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4305790/26